    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "> Living index of structured findings discovered during agent missions. > Each finding is recorded in `out-of-scope-findings.jsonl` with full structured metadata. > This Markdown index provides a human-readable summary sorted by finding kind.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
