    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Do not fix opportunistically.** Findings are recorded, classified, and turned into future work — not patched mid-mission. - **Append-only JSONL.** Agents append new rows to `out-of-scope-findings.jsonl`. Never edit or remove existing rows. - **Index is derived.** The Markdown index is regenerated from the JSONL. If the index is stale, regenerate it. - **Link from final reports.** Every mission final report should include a small \"Out-of-scope findings recorded\" section linking back to this registry.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
